  "name": "Deep Infection",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/blade-tip-orange.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The superficial wound closes easily, but the attack has left an insidious contamination deep inside. At the end of every long rest, roll your class's hit die and reduce your max hit points by this amount. If this effect reduces your hit points to 0, you fall <strong>&Reference[unconscious]{unconscious}</strong> and will die in [[1d6]] days.</p><p><em>Treatment</em> - Once per day you may attempt a [[/save con 22]] saving throw or a [[/skill medicine 17]] check. A success on either cures the infection. The Greater Restoration spell restores the max hit point damage as usual, but does not cure the infection.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
